      "writtenOn": "2022-01-29T00:20:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "hmm maybe we don\u0027t need the 256, I was being conservative here. However, let\u0027s do the math to take a better guess. A single-line would be considered \"long\" at about 100 chars and we probably need to use two lines for the complete longer messages. If we add a little buffer to that then 128 should fit the bill?",
      "parentUuid": "5c50973e_f57cf279",
      "revId": "8231081adb3515bb77d87c7475a7e17dfb9d6ac6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a3ddcf49_80526d4d",
        "filename": "include/uapi/linux/android/binder.h",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 287,
      "author": {
        "id": 1069543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-29T00:35:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The only case that exists so far is \"Success\" (7 bytes -- 8 if we need a terminating \u0027\\0\u0027). Adding some failure cases would help inform us on the size needed. I\u0027m guessing 128 is still quite a bit larger than required.",
      "parentUuid": "74cfd362_21918ba1",
      "revId": "8231081adb3515bb77d87c7475a7e17dfb9d6ac6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
