        "id": 1069543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-09T19:35:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are there examples where the string needs to be reduced to the point that important debugging info is lost? In those cases, then I suppose the binder_user_error() should remain. I suspect it is not the common case.",
      "parentUuid": "120ebb5c_1fcf4f80",
      "revId": "8231081adb3515bb77d87c7475a7e17dfb9d6ac6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
